      `the day fixed under section 61 of the 2020 Act is` IS A DATE @desc What is the day fixed under section 61 of 2020, c. 5? (not in the text of the Employment Insurance Act)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Does section 58 as it read before the day fixed under section 61 still govern my claim` IS
    `Act RP 2020 c. 5 s. 60 section 58 as it read immediately before the day fixed under section 61 continues to apply in respect of the claimant` `my benefit period began on` `the day fixed under section 61 of the 2020 Act is`

